    "reason": "evidence sufficient (proxy gate verdict; the open aspects need proposals): [ev-258dc0174ee7] says the PR adds support for the Gateway API HTTPRoute RequestHeaderModifier core filter \"to improve Gateway API spec support\". That makes this an added feature in the Kubernetes Gateway API provider. The changelog entry [ev-53aef8a0056b] and the changed files [ev-7176dff3f5ad] show it is implemented as a new headermodifier middleware behind the gatewayapi provider. This one feature explains the webui and middleware labels, so it is not several changes bundled together. That is enough to write the applicability: environments that use the Kubernetes Gateway API provider with HTTPRoutes that declare a RequestHeaderModifier filter. The consequence is additive, with no stated required action.",
